This patch belongs to the MGS Integral English text port
(MGSM2Fix, tools/integral-english/). It applies to:

    FoxdieTeam/mgs_reversing            https://github.com/FoxdieTeam/mgs_reversing
    at commit 7964de7fd2e9e8276a6307d59fc7a0cdf96aae21  (2026-08-27)

The MGS1 decompilation is that project's work, not this one's. The lines below
marked with a leading space or minus are theirs, quoted so the change can be
applied; the added lines are this port's. Building the three overlays this
patch changes - option.bin, preope.bin and abst.bin - requires a clone of their
repository, which this repository does not vendor.

That project states no licence. See CREDITS.md beside this file for what that
means and what has not been settled.

(git apply ignores this header and starts at the first "diff --git" line.)

